  "explanation": "A plain object inherits a truthy constructor property from its prototype. votes['constructor'] || 0 resolves to the inherited function (not 0), and adding 1 to it coerces the function to a string, producing a garbage-but-printable value instead of the count 1.",
  "prompt": "This tagger counts how often each design tag appears. Step through the tally and predict what it prints for the 'constructor' tag.",
